Hmm, was the click registered? "clicked": uid 3_12 at (70, 368) — the button is disabled in the DOM! `[disabled]` → a click on a disabled button does nothing ✓✓. The button was rendered disabled (because at render time draft.seats had 1 name) and remains disabled until a re-render occurs.

